#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:385
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Lub Teb Chaws Code yog siv los tsim cov lej uas tsis suav nrog cov npe thoob "
"ntiaj teb (piv txwv li, +358).\n"
"\n"
"Yog tias sab laug khoob, lub kaw lus sim ntes nws tau los ntawm koj daim "
"npav SIM lossis lub network.\n"
"\n"
"Koj tuaj yeem hla nws ntawm no los ntawm kev nkag mus rau 2 tsab ntawv ISO "
"cheeb tsam code (xws li US, FI, DE) lossis tus lej hu (xws li +358, 358, +1, "
"1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:413
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic uses the limit reported by the phone's MMS service, which is right "
"for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your messages fail to send, or a "
"larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Cov tuam txhab xov tooj txwv qhov loj ntawm cov lus multimedia. Cov duab "
"thiab yeeb yaj kiab uas koj ntxig yuav raug nyem kom me tsis siv neeg kom "
"poob qab qhov txwv no ua ntej xa.\n"
"\n"
"Tsis siv neeg siv qhov txwv uas lub xov tooj qhov kev pab cuam MMS qhia, uas "
"yog qhov yog rau feem ntau cov tuam txhab. Xaiv tus nqi me dua yog tias koj "
"cov lus xa tsis tau, lossis tus loj dua yog tias koj paub tias koj lub tuam "
"txhab tso cai."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:435
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Lub suab nrov nrov yog lub suab ua si (toot-toot-toot) thaum tos kom hu "
"xovtooj tuaj. Qee cov neeg nqa khoom tsis tsim nws yog li peb muaj kev xaiv "
"los tsim nws manually ntawm no. \n"
"\n"
"Koj tuaj yeem xaiv koj tus kheej cov ntaub ntawv suab paj nruag, lossis "
"tshem nws kom siv tus qauv suab nrov."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
